Third-party content notice:

`corpus/` bundles public electronic texts of Mao Zedong's writings collected
from the public archive 中文马克思主义文库 (https://www.marxists.org/chinese/).
Copyright in those texts belongs to their respective rights holders; they are
included here only for personal study and research, with source URLs recorded
in `corpus/index.json` and `corpus/README.md`. This project claims no rights in
them and does not sell them.

The pet artwork in `assets/` is AI-generated fan art of DeepSeek's unofficial
"whale girl" community mascot, dressed in a period Red Army uniform. It is not
official DeepSeek material and is not endorsed by DeepSeek. See
`assets/PROVENANCE.md`.
